{"id":"93cbfd6e6986f453","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-generic-hyperimmune.md","title":"1-generic 两侧的超免疫性","display":"thm-generic-hyperimmune — 1-generic 两侧的超免疫性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-generic-hyperimmune","aliases":["20-thm-generic-hyperimmune"],"display":"thm-generic-hyperimmune — 1-generic 两侧的超免疫性","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.3.5(ii)","source_printed_pages":[138],"source_pdf_pages":[172],"depends_on":["[[20-df-1gen]]","[[20-df-finite-array]]","[[20-df-hyperimmune]]","[[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-generic-hyperimmune"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-generic-hyperimmune</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-hyperimmune — 1-generic 两侧的超免疫性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.3.5(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"352368d98a9342b6\" href=\"?note=352368d98a9342b6\" title=\"20-df-finite-array\">20-df-finite-array</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89b88563124855ce\" href=\"?note=89b88563124855ce\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune\">20-df-hyperimmune</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6f4e11aea39794a8\" href=\"?note=6f4e11aea39794a8\" title=\"20-thm-generic-biimmune\">20-thm-generic-biimmune</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(G\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)\">\\(\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"352368d98a9342b6\" href=\"?note=352368d98a9342b6\" title=\"20-df-finite-array\">20-df-finite-array</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"89b88563124855ce\" href=\"?note=89b88563124855ce\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune\">20-df-hyperimmune</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6f4e11aea39794a8\" href=\"?note=6f4e11aea39794a8\" title=\"20-thm-generic-biimmune\">20-thm-generic-biimmune</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}hyperimmune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(G)\\land\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(\\omega\\setminus G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}hyperimmune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(G)\\land\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(\\omega\\setminus G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>假设强不交数组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 每列都击中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，则所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n\">\\(F_n\\)</span> 非空。串集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists n\\ [F_n\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\land\\forall x\\in F_n\\ \\sigma(x)=0]\\}\">\\(S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists n\\ [F_n\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\land\\forall x\\in F_n\\ \\sigma(x)=0]\\}\\)</span> 是 c.e.（实际上可有效搜索）。任意有限前缀只与有限多个互不相交的非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n\">\\(F_n\\)</span> 相交，故可找出完全位于该前缀之外的一列，并延伸将该列全部置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 稠密，generic 必碰到它，给出一列与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 不相交，矛盾。补集的证明改为全部置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；无限性由上游双免疫引理保证。不能用只枚举有限列、却不知道完整成员的弱数组代替这里的强数组。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.3.5(ii)；印刷页 138；PDF 第 172 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-1gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-array","status":"resolved","id":"352368d98a9342b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-array]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune","status":"resolved","id":"89b88563124855ce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-generic-biimmune","status":"resolved","id":"6f4e11aea39794a8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-array","status":"resolved","id":"352368d98a9342b6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune","status":"resolved","id":"89b88563124855ce","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-generic-biimmune","status":"resolved","id":"6f4e11aea39794a8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}hyperimmune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(G)\\land\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(\\omega\\setminus G).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"F_n","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists n\\ [F_n\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\land\\forall x\\in F_n\\ \\sigma(x)=0]\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F_n","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false}],"bytes":1733,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-generic-hyperimmune]] — 章 6；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-generic-hyperimmune]]"}],"outgoing":["b03a71cd282632fa","352368d98a9342b6","89b88563124855ce","6f4e11aea39794a8"]}